[31m+     // through the shared amount/invert stages. The worklet follower gives[39m
[31m+     // true asymmetric ballistics (2 ms attack, RELEASE-timed recovery);[39m
[31m+     // without the core bundle a native rectifier + smoothing-LP chain[39m
[31m+     // covers the same routing with symmetric ballistics (degraded flag).[39m
