[31m+     // The R oscillator runs at rate·(1 + 0.03·spread) — a slight detune that[39m
[31m+     // makes the L/R notches drift apart over time (classic pseudo-stereo[39m
[31m+     // phasing). spread 0 = identical chains = mono.[39m
